sw-global-war-ln-title = Emergency Ln reserve — your faction
sw-global-war-ln-help = This doctrine applies to your entire faction. Automatic trigger: the enclave is unreachable through the economic network and S < 20D. An empty accessible enclave or a busy lane alone does not trigger it.
sw-global-war-ln-doctrine-auto = Doctrine: automatic.
sw-global-war-ln-doctrine-off = Doctrine: disabled by the head.
sw-global-war-ln-starting = Preparing: { $seconds } of 120 active campaign seconds remain. At zero, await server confirmation.
sw-global-war-ln-supply = Stock S: { $stock } Ln. Normative demand D: { $demand } Ln/min. Trigger 20D: { $threshold } Ln.
    Your cargo heading to home industry: { $incoming } Ln; excluded from S.
    Civil electronics norm: { $electronics } units/min. T2 limit from Ln: { $t2 } units/min; actual output is not guaranteed.
sw-global-war-ln-deposit = { $planet }: { $remaining } Ln left; { $released } Ln extracted over the deposit's history. { $state }
sw-global-war-ln-cost = One deposit: 1 Ln per 5 eligible seconds, 400 GC from the treasury; up to 12 Ln/min. A minute order reserves funds; only actual releases are charged.
sw-global-war-ln-details = S includes your physical Ln at home industrial worlds and the base supply program's reservation. D is the civil electronics and base program norm even while production is stopped, not actual consumption. Crossing the threshold starts an episode; arriving Ln does not end it. Restoring enclave access ends the episode.
    Extracted totals include previous owners: they are neither your faction's payments nor deliveries to industry. See Freight for deliveries.
sw-global-war-ln-head-only = Only the current head can change this doctrine. Replacing the head does not lift a prohibition.
sw-global-war-ln-enable = Enable automatic reserve
sw-global-war-ln-disable = Disable automatic reserve
sw-global-war-ln-enable-effect = Intent: enable automatic reserve. Deposit balances are preserved; release is not immediate.
sw-global-war-ln-disable-effect = Intent: disable automatic reserve. Preparation and unfulfilled releases stop; their reserved funds are released. Produced goods remain.
sw-global-war-ln-enabled = This decision enabled automatic reserve.
sw-global-war-ln-disabled = This decision disabled automatic reserve.
sw-global-war-ln-conflict = The doctrine changed. The current decision is above; your previous intent is preserved. Load the current decision or explicitly reapply yours.
sw-global-war-ln-denied = Decision rejected. Check your current appointment and campaign state.
sw-global-war-ln-denied-head = Only the current head can change the doctrine.
sw-global-war-ln-denied-no-deposit = This campaign has no Ln deposits. The doctrine does not apply.
sw-global-war-ln-state-disabled = Disabled by the head.
sw-global-war-ln-state-waiting = Waiting for conditions.
sw-global-war-ln-state-starting = Preparing the episode.
sw-global-war-ln-state-releasing = Episode ready; actual release depends on each deposit's state.
sw-global-war-ln-state-norecipient = No owned home industrial recipients. Unmet normative demand remains.
sw-global-war-ln-state-nodeposit = No owned deposit. Switching the doctrine does not create stock.
sw-global-war-ln-state-exhausted = Available deposits exhausted. Switching the doctrine does not refill them.
sw-global-war-ln-state-waitingfunds = Release stopped: insufficient treasury funds.
sw-global-war-ln-state-waitingspace = Release stopped: insufficient room in the deposit's local market.
sw-global-war-ln-wait-none = Waiting for conditions.
sw-global-war-ln-wait-enclaveavailable = Waiting: the enclave is reachable through the economic network.
sw-global-war-ln-wait-stocksufficient = Waiting: stock S is at or above 20D.
sw-global-war-ln-wait-noenclave = Waiting: no original Ln enclave configured.
